    {
      "text": "Custom dashboards let you build personalized views of your organization's security profile so you can monitor the metrics most important to you."
    },
    {
      "text": "You can perform the following actions on custom dashboards you have created from the Custom Dashboards page (Analytics > Custom Dashboards):",
      "strong": [
        [
          85,
          102
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Edit a custom dashboard.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "To modify an existing custom dashboard:",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Click the name of the dashboard you want to edit.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "The dashboard opens in edit mode.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "In edit mode, you can do the following to the dashboard:",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Favorite it.",
      "depth": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "Click the Favorite icon () in the upper-right corner to mark this dashboard as a favorite. On the Custom Dashboards page, you can filter custom dashboards to only show your favorites.",
      "depth": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          10,
          18
        ],
        [
          98,
          115
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "Share it with other users.",
      "depth": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "Click the Share icon () in the upper-right corner to share this dashboard with others in your organization for viewing or collaboration.",
      "depth": 3,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          10,
          15
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 3
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Share Dashboard window:",
      "depth": 3,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          22
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Add People: Enter others in your organization who can access the dashboard.",
      "depth": 4,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          10
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Access: For each person, select the type of access:",
      "depth": 4,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          6
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Viewer: User can view the dashboard, but cannot edit it.",
      "depth": 5,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          6
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Editor: User can edit the widgets and layout of the dashboard.",
      "depth": 5,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          6
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "For either access type, users you share the dashboard with cannot delete it.",
      "depth": 4
    },
    {
      "item": "People with Access: Users you have previously shared the dashboard with are listed here. You can change their access or select Remove Access.",
      "depth": 4,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          18
        ],
        [
          127,
          140
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "(Optional) Click Copy Link to copy the direct link to this dashboard.",
      "depth": 3,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          17,
          26
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Share to save the changes and close the window.",
      "depth": 3,
      "number": 4,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          11
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "Rename it.",
      "depth": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "Click the Actions icon () in the upper-right corner and select Rename.",
